      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Watch the enchanting vocal rendition of the Maestro Pt. Sanjeev Abhayankar, whose voice is a favourite among thousands of his followers. A scintillating Hindustani vocal performance of his is something the entire season of SSF is looking up to. He has been accompanied on the Tabla by Maestro Pandit"
