    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Raag-Mala Toronto in partnership with Shadaj is proud to present a LIVE Online vocal recital by Bhuvanesh Komkali with Sanjay Deshpande on Tabla and Abhishek Shinkar on Harmonium Saturday February 27th, 2021 at 10 am EST (Canada) LIVE Online on the &quot;Shadaj Baithak&quot; YouTube channel ​Bhuvanesh Komkali received his initial training in music from his father Shri Mukul Shivputra&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/bhuvanesh-komkali-vocal-live-online-concert/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
