        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; Raag-Mala Toronto in partnership with Small World Music is proud to present a Jugalbandi by Pankaj Mishra &amp; Andrew Kay with Abbas Janmohamed on Tabla Monday September 13th, 2021 at 7pm EDT   FREE VIRTUAL EVENT Event Access: Raag-Mala Toronto Youtube Premiere AND on Raag-Mala Toronto\\'s Facebook Page Recorded live at the Small World Centre, this performance&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/jugalbandi-pankaj-mishra-andrew-kay/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
