        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;We are thrilled to have the opportunity to present a vocal recital by Aniruddh Aithal. Aniruddh will be accompanied by local artists Rigved Deshpande and Sushant Anantharam. Aniruddh Aithal is a 25-year-old Hindustani classical musician, vocal music being his area of expertise. From a very young age, Aniruddh was always exposed to classical music, primarily because of&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/vocal-recital-by-aniruddh-aithal/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
