        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SSF: Pt. Rajendra Gangani (Kathak Dance)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Kathak Maestro Pandit Rajendra Gangani is one of the biggest icons of modern day Kathak. The extremely powerful and vibrant maestro has given a thrilling performance studded with surreal intricacies and sheer elegance. He has been beautifully accompanied by Pt. Fateh Singh Gangani on the Tabla, Sami-ullah Khan on the Vocal, Mohamed Ayub Khan on&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/ssf-pt-rajendra-gangani-kathak-dance/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
