    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The enchanting Odissi by the young Odissi phenomenon, Arushi Mudgal, has been extraordinary. She is already a name in the field of Indian Classical Dance at this young age. Watch this stellar performance only on www.swarasamratfestival.com All the 36 concerts of this season of SSF have been specially shot by our state-of-the-art video and audio&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/ssf-arushi-mudgal-odissi-dance/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
