        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; Consulate General of India and Raag-Mala Toronto present Sowing the Seeds of Raag Sangeet in Canada An interactive session with artists Sri Narendra Datar &amp; Smt. Samidha Joglekar conducted by Manoshi Chatterjee Saturday September 11th, 2021 at 11am EDT FREE VIRTUAL EVENT Event Access: Watch on Facebook Watch on Youtube &nbsp; Sri Narendra Datar began&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/sowing-the-seeds-of-raag-sangeet-in-canada/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
