        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; Consulate General of India and Raag-Mala Toronto present Sowing the Seeds of Raag Sangeet in Canada An interactive session with artists Pankaj Mishra Geet Mishra George Koller conducted by Manoshi Chatterjee Premiering Tuesday August 9th at 11am EDT FREE VIRTUAL EVENT Event Access: Watch on Facebook Watch on YouTube Pankaj Mishra, who has recently&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/sowing-the-seeds-of-raag-sangeet-in-canada-2/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
