    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The fascinating Hindustani Slide Guitarist Deepak Kshirsagar and the incredible Carnatic Guitarist Abhay Nayampalli present a gripping Jugalbandi of Hindustani &amp; Carnatic Music. The brilliant Viveick Rajagopalan and Tanay Rege have ably accompanied them on the Mridangam and Tabla respectively. The soundscape created by the 4 of them is surely going to mesmerize all of&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;moretag&quot; href=&quot;https://raagmala.ca/concert/ssf-deepak-kshirsagar-abhay-nayampalli-guitar-duet/&quot;&gt;+ Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
