        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Watch the super exciting yet extremely musical Hindustani-Carnatic Flute-Veena Jugalbandi of the Hindustani Flute Maestro Pt. Pravin Godkhindi and Carnatic Saraswati Veena Maestro Vidushi Jayanthi Kumaresh. They have been accompanied by 2 other such maestros – Pt. Ravindra Yavagal on the Tabla"
