        "@value": " \n\n\nSarbari Roy Chowdhury Festival of Music\n\nDay 1 • Saturday, September 25th @ 8pm\n(Streaming @ 8pm in both IST & EDT)\n\nFeaturing Performances by:\n\n\n\n \tArindam Bhattacharya (Vocal) \n \tHiranmay Mitra (Harmonium) \n \tAshoke Mukherhee (Tabla)\n\n\n\n \tChiradip Sarkar"
